            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A flowerpot? (कुंडी, kuṇḍī.) A seedling? (रोप, rop.) A trunk? (खोड, khoḍ.) A lawn? (हिरवळ, hirvaḷ.) A footpath? (पायवाट, pāyvāṭ.) Leather? (चामडे, cāmḍe.) Metal? (धातू, dhātū.) A brick? (वीट, vīṭ.) A fine thread? (धागा, dhāgā.) A ladder? (शिडी, śiḍī.)"
            }
