              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A place? (ठिकाण, ṭhikāṇ.) A view? (देखावा, dekhāvā.) An outing? (सहल, sahal.) A griddle? (तवा, tavā.) A wok? (कढई, kaḍhaī.) Mustard seed? (मोहरी, moharī.) Coriander leaves? (कोथिंबीर, kothimbīr.) Curry leaves? (कढीपत्ता, kaḍhīpattā.) Peanuts? (शेंगदाणे, śeṅgdāṇe.) Cashews? (काजू, kājū.) A farm plot? (मळा, maḷā.) A cowshed? (गोठा, goṭhā.) A mosque? (मशीद, maśīd.) A college? (महाविद्यालय, mahāvidyālay.) A museum? (संग्रहालय, saṅgrahālay.)"
